\newlabel{app:discovery_results}{{B}{124}{Conformance of All Discovered Nets}{appendix.B}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {B.1}{\ignorespaces Conformance of all discovered nets on the training log (2 March to 11 April 2026) and the test log (13 to 30 April 2026). Fitness, fitting visits and accepted sequences: alignment replay in ProM 6.15 (costs 1 for a move on the log or on a visible transition, 0 for a silent move); fitness is the ProM trace fitness averaged over the visits. Fitting visits: share of visits whose complete sequence the net accepts. Precision: escaping-edges precision, ETConformance in ProM 6.15 on the discovered net, same settings for every net (``Lazy Invisibles'', ``First Indeterminism Solving''). \textsuperscript  {a}\,ETConformance counts 30 training and 15 test visits of IM 0.0 as non-fitting that fit under alignments (Section~\ref {sec:exp_discovery_eval}). Seq.\ accepted: training sequences accepted, of 82. Unseen test seq.: test sequences that do not occur in training and are accepted, of 16. Soundness: WOFLAN (PM4Py implementation). Values of unsound nets are diagnostic only. The prefix tree is a reference that accepts exactly the training sequences.}}{125}{table.caption.81}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:app_e1_conformance}{{B.1}{125}{Conformance of all discovered nets on the training log (2 March to 11 April 2026) and the test log (13 to 30 April 2026). Fitness, fitting visits and accepted sequences: alignment replay in ProM 6.15 (costs 1 for a move on the log or on a visible transition, 0 for a silent move); fitness is the ProM trace fitness averaged over the visits. Fitting visits: share of visits whose complete sequence the net accepts. Precision: escaping-edges precision, ETConformance in ProM 6.15 on the discovered net, same settings for every net (``Lazy Invisibles'', ``First Indeterminism Solving''). \textsuperscript {a}\,ETConformance counts 30 training and 15 test visits of IM 0.0 as non-fitting that fit under alignments (Section~\ref {sec:exp_discovery_eval}). Seq.\ accepted: training sequences accepted, of 82. Unseen test seq.: test sequences that do not occur in training and are accepted, of 16. Soundness: WOFLAN (PM4Py implementation). Values of unsound nets are diagnostic only. The prefix tree is a reference that accepts exactly the training sequences}{table.caption.81}{}}
